abstract: >-
  A two-document publication set describing an evidence-driven, repository-local
  multi-agent production framework for narrow Three.js browser-game vertical
  slices and an applied action-RPG production specification titled The Hollow
  Meridian, accompanied by standalone JSON Schema Draft 2020-12 contracts,
  copy-pasteable agent prompts, and golden reference fixtures. This release
  contains design specifications, schemas, and prompts, not a playable runtime
  implementation or empirical benchmark result.
